","target":"","line":107},{"title":"知识管理","target":"知识管理","line":111},{"title":"📘 README.md","target":"README.md","line":130},{"title":"🗺️ 文件夹结构树状图.md","target":"文件夹结构树状图.md","line":131},{"title":"⚙️ 配置指南.md","target":"配置指南.md","line":132},{"title":"⚡ 快速参考卡片.md","target":"快速参考卡片.md","line":138},{"title":"📝 示例笔记.md","target":"示例笔记.md","line":139},{"title":"✅ 使用检查清单.md","target":"使用检查清单.md","line":140},{"title":"✅ 构建完成总结.md","target":"使用说明/构建完成总结.md","line":146},{"title":"📊 项目概览.md","target":"项目概览.md","line":147},{"title":"笔记名","target":"笔记名","line":204},{"title":"[` 后会自动提示。\n\n### Q: 模板没有自动填充？\nA: 确保 Templater 插件已启用并正确配置。\n\n### Q: BASE 不显示笔记？\nA: 检查笔记是否在正确的文件夹中（Zettelkasten 或 Reference）。\n\n### Q: 如何修改模板？\nA: 直接编辑 `template/` 文件夹中的对应模板文件。\n\n### Q: 如何备份？\nA: 使用 Git 或复制到云存储/外部硬盘。\n\n**更多问题**：查看 [配置指南.md","target":"配置指南.md","line":204},{"title":"README.md","target":"README.md","line":245},{"title":"快速参考卡片.md","target":"快速参考卡片.md","line":246},{"title":"配置指南.md","target":"配置指南.md","line":247},{"title":"快速参考卡片.md","target":"快速参考卡片.md","line":264},{"title":"配置指南.md","target":"配置指南.md","line":265},{"title":"示例笔记.md","target":"示例笔记.md","line":266},{"title":"使用检查清单.md","target":"使用检查清单.md","line":267}],"metadata":{"created":"2026-02-25","title":"欢迎使用 Obsidian 知识管理系统","tags":["#welcome","#guide"]},"task_lines":[245,246,247,248],"tasks":{"incomplete":{"all":[245,246,247,248],"top":[245,246,247,248]}},"codeblock_ranges":[[64,81],[110,112]],"last_embed":{"hash":"18b0i29","at":1773829929605},"key":"使用说明/欢迎页面.md"},"smart_blocks:使用说明/欢迎页面.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"qkrh3w","at":1776056418369},"key":"使用说明/欢迎页面.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,5],"size":78,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
